   - Resolved the zoneless-change-detection-with-forms ambiguity by choosing a fully signal-driven approach for the checkout form instead of Angular Reactive Forms, sidestepping any uncertainty about whether `FormControl.markAsTouched()`/`statusChanges` would reliably trigger view updates without Zone.js.
